------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CLASS ACCURACY IS NOT ACTION ACCURACY
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                        action right    action wrong    
  class right           25              0               
  class wrong           0               0               

  `RCA accuracy` is the class row totals. The top-right cell is the
  one it cannot see: a correct fault class with a repair that class
  may not use. The gate catches it; the metric scores it correct.

  fault_name matches its own class code: 23/25
    F08 emitted with name 'Configuration regression' (catalogue says 'Configuration or environment regression')

  NOTHING IN THE GATE READS THIS. `deterministic_agreement`
  compares the class CODE; no check compares the name beside
  it. An incoherent pair is the model contradicting itself,
  and it can still heal correctly - which is the finding.
  Enforcing it would reject those diagnoses; that is a
  decision about the system, not a measurement of it.

